# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# VOICEVOX CORE resources (onnxruntime, dict, vvm models) — fetched locally via
# voicevox_core/download.exe, not meant to be committed.
/voicevox_core/

# SenseVoice model, downloaded on demand from Settings (see sense_voice.rs) —
# not meant to be committed. Also matters for `tauri dev`: its file watcher
# respects .gitignore, and without this the large file growing mid-download
# gets picked up as a source change, triggering a rebuild/restart that kills
# the app partway through.
/sense_voice/
